{
  "uid": "flujo-multicloud",
  "title": "Flujo multicloud unificado",
  "description": "Pokenetes (AWS), biblio-express (Azure) y Hospitaline (GCP) como un solo sistema. Trazas, RED de api/v2, cola, caché y logs correlacionados por trace-id.",
  "tags": ["pokenetes", "multicloud", "seguimiento-2"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "Servicio",
        "type": "custom",
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": "pokenetes-api|pokenetes-orchestrator|biblio-api-azure|hospitaline-api",
        "query": "pokenetes-api,pokenetes-orchestrator,biblio-api-azure,hospitaline-api",
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "options": [
          { "text": "All", "value": "$__all", "selected": true },
          { "text": "pokenetes-api", "value": "pokenetes-api", "selected": false },
          { "text": "pokenetes-orchestrator", "value": "pokenetes-orchestrator", "selected": false },
          { "text": "biblio-api-azure", "value": "biblio-api-azure", "selected": false },
          { "text": "hospitaline-api", "value": "hospitaline-api", "selected": false }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "trace_id",
        "label": "trace-id",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "e637dab8454a62a8d76250e85939df96",
        "current": { "text": "e637dab8454a62a8d76250e85939df96", "value": "e637dab8454a62a8d76250e85939df96" }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Un solo sistema",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 16, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "El recorrido es **cliente → orquestador → SQS → worker → /last de Pokenetes (AWS), Biblio (Azure) y Hospitaline (GCP)**.\n\nEl `trace-id` de arriba es el de Grafana. Las tres nubes comparten ese id cuando el flujo sale del orquestador. El `x-trace-id` es el UUID de la URL `/api/v2/flujo/:id`.\n\nDatasources: Prometheus y Tempo y Loki de Grafana Cloud, CloudWatch, Azure Monitor / Azure Prometheus, Google Cloud Monitoring."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Alerta del flujo",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Condición:** errores de `POST /api/v2/flujo` por encima de 0 durante 1 minuto.\n\nQuery: `sum(rate(http_server_errors_total{service_name=\"pokenetes-orchestrator\",http_route=~\"/api/v2/flujo.*\"}[5m]))`\n\n**Canal:** Alerting → Contact points → el email del grupo.\n\nPara dispararla en la sustentación: apaga una nube y haz `POST /api/v2/flujo`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Peticiones / s",
      "description": "Tasa de peticiones de api/v2.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "grafanacloud-prudentscorpion3034-prom" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "decimals": 2 } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_total{service_name=~\"$service\",http_route=~\"/api/v2.*\"}[5m]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Errores / s",
      "description": "Tasa de errores de api/v2.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "grafanacloud-prudentscorpion3034-prom" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 3,
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 0.01 }] }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_errors_total{service_name=~\"$service\",http_route=~\"/api/v2.*\"}[5m]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Latencia p95",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "grafanacloud-prudentscorpion3034-prom" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "decimals": 3 } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=~\"$service\",http_route=~\"/api/v2.*\"}[5m])))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Mensajes pendientes",
      "description": "Mensajes en SQS pokenetes-flujo que el worker todavía no termina.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 5 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "grafanacloud-prudentscorpion3034-prom" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0 } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max(queue_messages_pending)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tasa de peticiones por endpoint api/v2",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 9 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "grafanacloud-prudentscorpion3034-prom" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}} {{http_request_method}} {{http_route}}",
          "expr": "sum by (service_name, http_request_method, http_route) (rate(http_server_requests_total{service_name=~\"$service\",http_route=~\"/api/v2.*\"}[5m]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tasa de errores por endpoint api/v2",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 9 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "grafanacloud-prudentscorpion3034-prom" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}} {{http_route}} {{http_response_status_code}}",
          "expr": "sum by (service_name, http_route, http_response_status_code) (rate(http_server_errors_total{service_name=~\"$service\",http_route=~\"/api/v2.*\"}[5m]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latencia p50 y p95 por endpoint api/v2",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 17 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "grafanacloud-prudentscorpion3034-prom" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "p95 {{service_name}} {{http_route}}",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, service_name, http_route) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=~\"$service\",http_route=~\"/api/v2.*\"}[5m])))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "p50 {{service_name}} {{http_route}}",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le, service_name, http_route) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service_name=~\"$service\",http_route=~\"/api/v2.*\"}[5m])))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Cola: mensajes pendientes",
      "description": "Métrica del orquestador y la misma cola vista desde CloudWatch.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 25 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "grafanacloud-prudentscorpion3034-prom" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "grafanacloud-prudentscorpion3034-prom" },
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "OpenTelemetry",
          "expr": "max(queue_messages_pending)"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "cloudwatch", "uid": "cloudwatch" },
          "refId": "B",
          "queryMode": "Metrics",
          "region": "us-east-1",
          "namespace": "AWS/SQS",
          "metricName": "ApproximateNumberOfMessagesVisible",
          "statistic": "Average",
          "matchExact": true,
          "metricQueryType": 0,
          "metricEditorMode": 0,
          "dimensions": { "QueueName": ["pokenetes-flujo"] },
          "alias": "CloudWatch pokenetes-flujo"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Cola: mensajes reprocesados",
      "description": "Entregas de SQS con ApproximateReceiveCount mayor que 1.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 25 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "grafanacloud-prudentscorpion3034-prom" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "reprocesados",
          "expr": "sum(rate(queue_messages_reprocessed_total[5m]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Caché: aciertos",
      "description": "La caché es de Biblio y Hospitaline. El panel lee cache_hits_total si esas APIs la exportan a este Prometheus.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 33 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "grafanacloud-prudentscorpion3034-prom" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}",
          "expr": "sum by (service_name) (rate(cache_hits_total{service_name=~\"$service\"}[5m]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Caché: fallos",
      "description": "Fallos de caché exportados por Biblio y Hospitaline.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 33 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "grafanacloud-prudentscorpion3034-prom" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}",
          "expr": "sum by (service_name) (rate(cache_misses_total{service_name=~\"$service\"}[5m]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "traces",
      "title": "Trazas del flujo por las tres nubes",
      "description": "Spans flujo.pokenetes, flujo.biblio-express y flujo.hospitaline, más las llamadas api/v2. Pega otro trace-id en la variable de arriba para abrir esa traza.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 40 },
      "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "grafanacloud-prudentscorpion3034-traces" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "grafanacloud-prudentscorpion3034-traces" },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "limit": 20,
          "query": "{ resource.service.name =~ \"$service\" && (name =~ \"flujo.+\" || span.http.route =~ \"/api/v2.+\") }"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Logs del flujo por trace-id",
      "description": "Logs que Grafana recibió por OpenTelemetry. Filtra con la variable trace-id.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 50 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "grafanacloud-prudentscorpion3034-logs" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "grafanacloud-prudentscorpion3034-logs" },
          "expr": "{service_name=~\"$service\"} |~ \"$trace_id\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "CloudWatch: logs de EKS por trace-id",
      "description": "Log group de Container Insights. Correlaciona el mismo trace-id con los pods del clúster.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 50 },
      "datasource": { "type": "cloudwatch", "uid": "cloudwatch" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "cloudwatch", "uid": "cloudwatch" },
          "queryMode": "Logs",
          "region": "us-east-1",
          "expression": "fields @timestamp, @message | filter @message like /$trace_id/ | sort @timestamp desc | limit 40",
          "logGroups": [
            {
              "name": "/aws/containerinsights/pokenetes-test/application",
              "arn": "arn:aws:logs:us-east-1:722500516562:log-group:/aws/containerinsights/pokenetes-test/application:*"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Azure: peticiones de biblio-express",
      "description": "Prometheus administrado de Azure. Misma tasa de api/v2, vista desde la nube de Phol.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 59 },
      "datasource": { "type": "grafana-azureprometheus-datasource", "uid": "grafana-azureprometheus-datasource" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_route}}",
          "expr": "sum by (http_route) (rate(http_server_requests_total{service_name=\"biblio-api-azure\",http_route=~\"/api/v2.*\"}[5m]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "GCP: Cloud Monitoring",
      "description": "Fuente nativa de Dhani. Si pide project id, es el proyecto de Hospitaline. Las trazas de hospitaline-api igual están en el panel de Tempo.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 59 },
      "datasource": { "type": "stackdriver", "uid": "stackdriver" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "metrics",
          "editorMode": "visual",
          "metricType": "run.googleapis.com/request_count",
          "metricKind": "DELTA",
          "valueType": "INT64",
          "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_RATE",
          "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM",
          "alignmentPeriod": "cloud-monitoring-auto",
          "preprocessor": "rate",
          "filters": [],
          "groupBys": [],
          "aliasBy": "hospitaline requests",
          "projectName": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
